Examples retained for SSH forwarding and key management.

SFTP, SCP, shell, exec, PTY, X11 and desktop SSH-agent examples have been removed
because these APIs are not part of the VPN-focused fork. For executable direct-tcpip
examples and lifecycle handling, see src/test/java/com/jcraft/jsch/TunnelLoopbackIT.java.

The original examples and documentation remain available in the upstream Git history.
